WEBVTT

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:15.200
<b><i>Planet With</i></b>

00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:34.110
Miu-chan! Miu-chan!

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:34.900
Are you okay?

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:36.270
Come in!

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:41.410
<b>Episode 3: Avenger 1</b>

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:37.360
Miu-chan!

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:39.100
No...

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:42.620
My... My power!

00:01:43.140 --> 00:01:44.570
They're just standing there!

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:45.120
If we attack now...

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:46.000
Soya-kun!

00:01:57.930 --> 00:01:59.260
Kumashiro! Inaba!

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:00.690
Are you okay?

00:02:00.690 --> 00:02:03.280
I'm fine. Miu-chan...

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:04.810
I don't think she's hurt.

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:06.110
But...

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:08.330
Whoopsie...

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:10.230
Don't try to fight back.

00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:15.010
Soya, give up and let them catch you.

00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:16.940
We'll work something out.

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:18.450
That's what Sensei says.

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:19.910
Shut up!

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:22.220
All of you, line up!

00:02:22.220 --> 00:02:23.780
I'll take you all out, one by one!

00:02:26.150 --> 00:02:28.000
I'm no invader!

00:02:28.270 --> 00:02:29.500
I'm an avenger!

00:02:30.390 --> 00:02:33.290
Anybody who uses the power of the 
dragon that destroyed my planet...

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:35.000
I'll beat the crap out of them!

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:36.880
Avenger?

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:38.800
Power of the dragon?

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:42.010
So, what's the next move, Takashi?

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:46.140
Everyone, capture the Nebula Soldier!

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:54.940
No, Soya-kun!

00:02:57.160 --> 00:03:00.420
I... I...

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:01.370
It's dangerous!

00:03:01.370 --> 00:03:02.160
We're getting out of here!

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:05.330
He's heading towards you, Nezuya!

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:06.410
Got him!

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:10.830
He jumped off me?

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:12.790
You'll pay for hurting Miu-chan!

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:17.630
Giga Cat Hammer!

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:30.730
Sensei! Soya-kun!

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:33.600
I got him!

00:03:33.820 --> 00:03:35.730
Well done, Kumashiro-kun.

00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:37.610
Nebula Soldier,

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:39.990
disarm yourself and surrender.

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:43.070
If you don't, we'll destroy you!

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:52.210
Giga Cat Hammer!

00:03:58.770 --> 00:04:01.300
I can at least crush their leader!

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:04.320
Giga Cat Hammer!

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:11.860
Psychokinetic Mega-God Photon Armor!

00:04:17.350 --> 00:04:18.470
Very well.

00:04:21.470 --> 00:04:22.780
Destruction it is.

00:04:23.090 --> 00:04:25.960
Thor's Hammer!

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:45.800
It's so powerful...

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:49.730
The cliff melted!

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:53.770
Here I go!

00:05:10.510 --> 00:05:11.740
Time to end this.

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:15.160
He's strong.

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:24.270
I feel the aura most intensely from him...

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:27.630
The aura of the dragon 
that destroyed my planet!

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:31.870
Sensei, don't tell me...

00:05:33.570 --> 00:05:34.180
What?

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:35.480
The sky's glowing?

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:36.850
What's going on?

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:38.560
Something's coming?

00:05:39.140 --> 00:05:41.020
Meow!

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:50.070
What is that?

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:52.030
A Nebula Weapon?

00:06:26.730 --> 00:06:28.990
H-He ate them.

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:34.280
Everyone, retreat.

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:38.050
Why?

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:42.460
Couldn't the director's 
beam take that thing out?

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:43.750
I don't know.

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:46.580
I'm sure he has his reasons.

00:06:47.150 --> 00:06:48.340
Let's go.

00:06:51.900 --> 00:06:53.070
Haru-chan?

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:57.330
Nebula Soldier!

00:06:57.330 --> 00:06:59.500
Next time, fight me!

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:00.640
One on one!

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:03.360
I'll defeat you!

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:04.920
Haru-chan?

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:06.300
Let's go.

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:18.290
This is a major failure.

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:21.480
Letting a Siriusian child boss you around

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:27.420
<b>Earth</b>

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:27.420
<b>Nebula</b>

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:27.420
<b>Sealing Faction
Pacifist Faction</b>

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:25.210
is a grave insult to the 
honor of we Kigurumians,

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:27.420
and we're the only armed 
force that Nebula has.

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:32.140
How long are you going to keep 
that Siriusian around, anyway?

00:07:32.140 --> 00:07:34.300
Is this your attempt to atone?

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:36.730
His power is very useful.

00:07:37.320 --> 00:07:39.310
His desire for combat and psychic powers

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:41.780
are something the races 
that joined Nebula lack,

00:07:41.780 --> 00:07:44.060
and they amplify my own power.

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:46.140
But they went out of control.

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:49.970
It's obvious why Sirius was destroyed.

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:54.030
Sirius was destroyed because 
I failed to save them.

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:55.220
No!

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:59.900
Their desire for conflict drove them 
to achieve the evolution of power!

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:02.370
They should've been sealed 
before it happened!

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:05.800
Sealed races cease to evolve.

00:08:05.800 --> 00:08:09.840
Is that the right choice for a race 
that chose the evolution of love?

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:14.300
It's a less sad fate than destruction.

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:18.760
I want to watch over them... 
these Earthlings.

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:21.960
Until they are destroyed, like Sirius?

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:24.630
That's a rather unpleasant hobby.

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:26.830
The dragon is gone.

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:29.070
We won't see a repeat of Sirius.

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:32.530
But the Earthlings used the dragon's power.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:35.010
It's only a matter of time 
before it goes out of control.

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:38.340
That's why we're hurrying to 
recover the dragon's power.

00:08:38.340 --> 00:08:39.160
Give us a little time.

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:41.080
I can't do that.

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:43.990
Forget about Sirius already.

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:47.130
Any responsibility you 
feel is simply arrogance.

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:48.680
I...

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:52.090
Generalissimo, we need to go.

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:53.550
It's time.

00:08:53.740 --> 00:08:57.260
Farewell, Pacifist of Chaotic Black.

00:08:58.130 --> 00:08:59.020
I see.

00:08:59.670 --> 00:09:03.350
Goodbye, then, Sealer of Fastidious White.

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:16.110
<b>Space</b>

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:17.570
A dream...

00:09:18.810 --> 00:09:21.780
So that fried chicken was a dream, too?

00:09:21.780 --> 00:09:24.160
Oh, Soya-kun's awake!

00:09:25.800 --> 00:09:29.840
Soya-kun, you were asleep for three days.
 You used too much of your power.

00:09:30.160 --> 00:09:31.300
Are you okay?

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:33.340
My power?

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:36.820
Didn't we get swallowed by a huge cat?

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:38.800
What happened to those guys?

00:09:40.110 --> 00:09:42.500
That's my spaceship.

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:45.700
The ship and the apartment are 
connected by a short warp.

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:48.650
That's a spaceship?

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:52.400
The Earthlings fled right after that.

00:09:52.640 --> 00:09:54.860
That's what Sensei says.

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:57.130
Sensei, your arm...

00:09:57.790 --> 00:09:59.070
It'll be fine soon.

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:02.270
What about you, Soya? 
Does anything feel wrong?

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:04.290
That's what Sensei says.

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:06.040
I'm fine.

00:10:06.530 --> 00:10:08.500
Sorry, Sensei.

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:10.740
<i>It's been three days since then.</i>

00:10:10.740 --> 00:10:14.090
<i>The huge object that landed 
in the mountains hasn't moved.</i>

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:15.880
You left that there?

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:17.300
It'll stay there for a while.

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:20.480
<i>Let's talk to a local middle schooler.</i>

00:10:20.480 --> 00:10:21.510
<i>Excuse me.</i>

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:22.890
<i>I'm in high school.</i>

00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:24.660
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:24.660
Oh, our class rep.

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:26.100
<i>What do you think about this mess?</i>

00:10:26.360 --> 00:10:27.560
<i>It's scary.</i>

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:30.230
<i>One of my classmates 
stopped coming to school.</i>

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:31.440
<i>I'm worried.</i>

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:33.320
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:35.350
Why not go to school?

00:10:35.830 --> 00:10:37.630
Yeah, I will.

00:10:38.060 --> 00:10:40.140
And Ginko, I'm sorry.

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:44.050
That beam the enemy fired 
was really dangerous.

00:10:44.880 --> 00:10:47.600
Oh, I peed myself a little then.

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:50.910
<i>He said he was going to the bathroom</i>

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:53.490
<i>and hasn't been back for days.</i>

00:10:53.490 --> 00:10:55.140
<i>Do you think he ever found the bathroom?</i>

00:10:55.140 --> 00:10:57.130
<i>I'm sure he did, yes.</i>

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:03.470
Kumashiro's really into this...

00:11:01.570 --> 00:11:03.240
One more match, please!

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:06.180
Does she really plan to fight on her own?

00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:11.270
I'll defeat the Nebula Soldiers myself!

00:11:20.420 --> 00:11:22.800
Kuroi-kun, are you free after school?

00:11:22.800 --> 00:11:23.910
Can you come with me?

00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:26.620
Sure, that's fine.

00:11:30.860 --> 00:11:32.790
What is this place?

00:11:33.150 --> 00:11:35.380
The occult research club's room.

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:37.250
You like this stuff, right, Kuroi-kun?

00:11:37.770 --> 00:11:40.370
You got really excited when you saw that UFO.

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:41.380
<b>Aliens?
Mole People?
Ancients?
It's Alive?</b>

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:41.380
<b>Hands?</b>

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:41.380
<b>"Peas"</b>

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:41.380
<b>Ears?</b>

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:41.380
<b>Spelled Wrong
"Peace"?</b>

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:41.380
<b>○Fires mysterious
 beams of light
○Flies</b>

00:11:40.370 --> 00:11:41.380
Oh...

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:44.460
<i>After getting my memories back and 
what's happened over the last few days,</i>

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:46.750
<i>I'm sick of all that stuff, though.</i>

00:11:48.480 --> 00:11:49.770
Come in.

00:11:50.050 --> 00:11:51.410
Okay, sure.

00:11:54.190 --> 00:11:59.110
If you stay cooped up at home, you'll just 
get more depressed and anxious, right?

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:02.270
I was worried, since you 
weren't coming to school.

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:08.040
Thanks, Class Rep.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:10.500
Nozomi Takamagahara.

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.680
Remember my name!

00:12:12.680 --> 00:12:14.550
Tama... hara?

00:12:14.550 --> 00:12:16.290
Ta-ka-ma-ga-ha-ra!

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:20.260
Nozomi... Can I call you "Nozo-san"?

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:22.470
That sounds like an old man's nickname.

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:24.640
Runyah!

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:26.160
Club President!

00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:27.640
Runyah!

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:29.230
Kuroi-kun, you, too!

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:31.100
Runyah! Do it!

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:34.480
Run... What is this?

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:36.360
The club's greeting!

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:38.110
Nozomi-chan, who's this?

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:40.310
Kuroi-kun, our new member.

00:12:40.970 --> 00:12:41.470
I'm...

00:12:41.470 --> 00:12:43.740
Aw, glad to have you, Kuroi-kun!

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:45.610
<b>Entrance
Paperwork</b>

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:45.610
Here's your entrance paperwork!

00:12:45.980 --> 00:12:47.570
But I never...

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:51.040
Accepted.

00:12:53.670 --> 00:12:56.650
That makes five! Now we 
can keep the club open!

00:12:56.650 --> 00:12:58.460
The other two are ghosts, though.

00:12:58.850 --> 00:13:01.230
Ghosts? This place has ghosts?

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:04.650
No... "Ghost members."
People who never come to the club.

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:06.780
He's so cute!

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:13.350
Runyah!

00:13:13.990 --> 00:13:14.580
Ru—

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:16.060
Runyah!

00:13:16.630 --> 00:13:17.760
What's wrong, senpai?

00:13:17.760 --> 00:13:19.200
It's been forever!

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:21.030
I was just passing by.

00:13:21.310 --> 00:13:22.140
Is he part of the club?

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:24.240
This is Nezuya-senpai. He was
 a member before he graduated.

00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:27.290
Graduated? But he's wearing our uniform.

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:28.700
It's cosplay, he says.

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:33.040
We managed to avoid being shut 
down again this year, senpai.

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:35.600
Say hello, Kuroi-kun.

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:37.080
Ru... Run...

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:38.730
Runyah!

00:13:39.770 --> 00:13:41.490
What type are you?

00:13:41.490 --> 00:13:42.300
Type?

00:13:42.560 --> 00:13:45.780
Kuroi-kun's the UFO type, right?
 He likes those.

00:13:45.780 --> 00:13:48.100
I'm the ghost story type.

00:13:48.100 --> 00:13:49.510
I like UFOs, too.

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:52.100
I like magic.

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:55.560
I like UMAs! Unidentified mysterious animals.

00:13:55.850 --> 00:14:00.370
As you can see, the "occult" 
consists of a multitude of genres.

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:04.010
And here, you'll find many different books.

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:06.150
Take any you like.

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:09.730
Sometimes I come to borrow them myself.

00:14:10.900 --> 00:14:13.460
Nezuya-senpai just carries them to look cool.

00:14:13.460 --> 00:14:14.950
He doesn't read them.

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:17.270
That's senpai for you! He's so lame!

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:21.210
Okay, time to get started!

00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:24.040
Everybody, do independent research 
until the school closes!

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:25.160
Okay!

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:30.140
Kuroi-kun, want to see what I put 
together about that huge object?

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:30.890
No.

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:33.040
The internet moves fast.

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:35.600
Magazines are so slow, they might 
not have the news next month.

00:14:35.820 --> 00:14:37.970
Well, that's just how they work.

00:14:37.970 --> 00:14:39.230
Yeah, I guess.

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:44.270
<b>Tracking Down
 Unidentified Animals</b>

00:14:54.810 --> 00:14:58.440
Kuroi-kun, if you see anything 
you like, you can borrow the book.

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:00.000
Okay.

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:03.500
Have we met somewhere?

00:15:05.990 --> 00:15:07.460
No. I don't think so.

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:09.370
Kuroi-kun,

00:15:09.370 --> 00:15:11.810
could this be a clue about your amnesia?

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:13.550
Amnesia?

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:17.760
But that's already...

00:15:17.760 --> 00:15:21.100
So... So cool!

00:15:22.550 --> 00:15:24.540
"Cool"?

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:29.070
I think it's too serious to be joking about.

00:15:29.460 --> 00:15:31.400
I'm s-sorry, I didn't mean...

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:33.960
No, um...

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:37.510
My name is Judgment Nezuya.

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:39.840
Judgment, as in <i>justice</i>!

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:43.430
My father, who once wanted to 
be a lawyer, gave it to me!

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:48.610
I'm glad we've become friends.

00:15:48.610 --> 00:15:49.580
Nice to meet you.

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:51.550
Uh... thanks.

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:52.600
Friends?

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:57.420
Lawyer? Your family's run a brewery 
since your great-grandpa's time.

00:15:58.590 --> 00:16:00.930
Soon... we'll be opening a convenience store.

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:02.090
Really?

00:16:02.090 --> 00:16:04.540
That's great, since I live close to you!

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:05.360
Friends...

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:09.970
Senpai, can you remember 
where you met Kuroi-kun?

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:15.320
I remember something... white and black.

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:16.710
White and black?

00:16:17.130 --> 00:16:18.750
Want to try this then?

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:30.080
It's all black.

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:31.320
You win.

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:32.610
Well done.

00:16:32.610 --> 00:16:34.160
He's so bad at it!

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:36.830
Can I play, too?

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:37.380
Sure.

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:38.730
Me, too!

00:16:40.110 --> 00:16:42.600
Okay, you two, take care.

00:16:42.780 --> 00:16:44.490
Let us meet again, my friend.

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:47.820
If I remember any clues regarding 
your memories, I'll tell you immediately.

00:16:48.160 --> 00:16:49.680
See you later.

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:51.780
Thanks. Bye.

00:16:53.890 --> 00:16:54.740
Sorry.

00:16:54.970 --> 00:16:55.890
For what?

00:16:56.300 --> 00:16:57.360
A bunch of stuff.

00:16:57.360 --> 00:16:59.360
Making you join the club.

00:16:59.360 --> 00:17:01.330
Or saying you had amnesia.

00:17:01.610 --> 00:17:02.680
It's fine.

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:04.160
It was kind of fun.

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:06.650
Really? I'm glad.

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:10.700
Anyway, my house is over this way.

00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:11.420
Okay.

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:12.830
See you tomorrow.

00:17:13.850 --> 00:17:15.720
Yeah, see you.

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:42.080
Vegetable curry...

00:17:42.810 --> 00:17:44.120
Let's eat.

00:17:45.030 --> 00:17:47.860
You're late. How was school?

00:17:47.860 --> 00:17:48.790
Okay, I guess.

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:51.250
I see. Glad to hear it.

00:17:52.850 --> 00:17:58.620
If you want, you can stay
 on Earth, Sensei says.

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:02.680
Once...

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:05.310
Once my revenge is complete.

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:08.600
I don't think it's a bad deal for you.

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:11.270
Siriusians and Earthlings are...

00:18:13.410 --> 00:18:14.280
Sensei!

00:18:21.770 --> 00:18:25.450
I'll defeat both the Nebula Weapons
 and the Nebula Soldiers!

00:18:25.820 --> 00:18:27.240
Back me up!

00:18:27.240 --> 00:18:29.420
Hey, your personality changed, Kumashiro.

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:30.210
Are you okay?

00:18:30.510 --> 00:18:31.820
I'm fine!

00:18:31.820 --> 00:18:34.070
We haven't finished with 
the one in the mountain,

00:18:34.070 --> 00:18:36.160
and now there are more...

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:38.050
There it is!

00:18:45.660 --> 00:18:46.770
What the hell?

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:47.450
Wh—

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:48.780
Scary, scary, scary!

00:18:48.780 --> 00:18:51.110
What the hell are those things?!

00:18:55.730 --> 00:18:58.490
Ugh... What the heck is that?

00:18:58.850 --> 00:19:00.850
Giant upside-down babies?

00:19:00.850 --> 00:19:02.230
So cute!

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:05.360
Mokele-mbembe is cuter.

00:19:05.360 --> 00:19:06.910
What's that?

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:08.790
Can you hear me, everyone?

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:09.870
It's me, Shiraishi.

00:19:10.390 --> 00:19:12.800
There may appear to be multiple enemies,

00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:14.780
but there should only be one core.

00:19:14.780 --> 00:19:17.300
Stay sharp, and find its weak spot.

00:19:17.690 --> 00:19:18.880
<i>Shiraishi-san...</i>

00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:19.630
Yes?

00:19:19.910 --> 00:19:21.890
You know an awful lot about the enemy.

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:25.060
For now, focus.

00:19:25.270 --> 00:19:27.060
Weak point! Where's the weak point?

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:31.480
Weak point! Weak point!

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:33.740
I'm so dizzy...

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:35.770
I found it! The weak spot!

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:39.290
Get inside and destroy the core!

00:19:39.290 --> 00:19:40.230
Roger!

00:19:41.710 --> 00:19:43.320
Wait, I'll go, too!

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:06.890
Come here.

00:20:07.590 --> 00:20:08.740
Miu-chan...

00:20:15.140 --> 00:20:16.440
Do you remember?

00:20:16.870 --> 00:20:20.410
When a boy was teasing me in 5th grade,

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:22.440
you threw him over your shoulder.

00:20:22.440 --> 00:20:26.110
Yeah. I knocked over a desk 
and made a huge noise.

00:20:26.110 --> 00:20:27.660
Everybody was freaked out.

00:20:27.890 --> 00:20:30.260
But you were so cool.

00:20:30.260 --> 00:20:32.870
That's why I started judo, too.

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:34.780
I wanted to be like you.

00:20:37.120 --> 00:20:39.570
When I first saw you, Miu-chan,

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:42.340
I thought a princess had 
transferred into our school.

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:49.060
<b>Miu Inaba</b>

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:45.740
I wanted to be like you.

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:49.060
Now you're the princess. Look.

00:20:57.130 --> 00:20:58.300
Miu-chan?

00:20:58.800 --> 00:21:00.110
I'm a prince.

00:21:00.500 --> 00:21:02.920
I came to save you, princess.

00:21:10.640 --> 00:21:12.000
I'm sorry.

00:21:12.570 --> 00:21:15.460
I couldn't save you then.

00:21:22.560 --> 00:21:23.470
Just watch.

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:26.550
I'll avenge your lost smile, Miu-chan!

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:33.020
<b>"Nobody's afraid of you."</b>

00:21:45.250 --> 00:21:47.490
Th-The Nebula Weapon was destroyed!

00:21:48.900 --> 00:21:50.220
Where's Nezuya-kun?!

00:21:56.290 --> 00:21:57.670
Nezuya! Hey!

00:21:57.910 --> 00:21:59.840
Director, Nezuya-kun is...

00:22:04.740 --> 00:22:07.320
N-Nezuya-senpai?!

00:22:07.930 --> 00:22:09.930
<b><i>To Be Continued</i></b>

00:23:39.940 --> 00:23:45.230
<b><i>Next Time
Avenger 2</i></b>

00:23:42.890 --> 00:23:45.190
"Avenger 2."
